# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can obtain the kernel function value $K(x, x)$ by measuring the "
"probability of the all-zero bitstring `00...00` in the output.\n"
msgstr ""
"Den Kernfunktionswert $K(x, x)$ erhältst du, indem du die Wahrscheinlichkeit"
" des Null-Bitstrings `00...00` in der Ausgabe misst.\n"

